<li><strong>Accidental Damage:</strong> Repairs for scratches, dents, or mechanical failures caused by road accidents during transit.</li>
<li><strong>Theft and Loss:</strong> Full compensation if the vehicle is stolen or permanently lost while in the custody of the transport agency.</li>
<li><strong>Natural Calamities:</strong> Protection against damage resulting from floods, landslides, or severe weather conditions common on the Pune-Chandigarh route.</li>
<li><strong>Third-Party Liability:</strong> Coverage for any legal liabilities arising from the bike’s transit, ensuring you are not held responsible for incidents outside your control.</li>
</ul>

